ue processing\n- Conflict resolution with version tracking\n\n#### **Phase 6: PWA Integration & Mobile Optimization**\n- Updated PWA manifest with shortcuts\n- Push notification system with Web Push API\n- Mobile installation prompts\n- Performance optimization (< 3s load time)\n- Service worker caching strategies\n\n#### **Phase 7: Testing & Deployment**\n- Comprehensive mobile device testing (iOS/Android)\n- Offline functionality testing\n- Performance audits (Lighthouse 90+ scores)\n- Beta testing program\n- Production deployment with monitoring\n\n### **🎨 DESIGN SPECIFICATIONS:**\n```css\n--deep-ocean: #2C5282;     /* Main brand color */\n--fresh-green: #38A169;    /* Success, verified states */\n--energy-orange: #ED8936;  /* Active states, notifications */\n--pure-white: #FFFFFF;     /* Backgrounds, cards */\n--charcoal: #2D3748;       /* Primary text */\n--steel: #4A5568;          /* Secondary text */\n```\n\n### **📊 SUCCESS METRICS:**\n- **User Adoption:** 80%+ mobile usage\n- **Performance:** < 3s load time on 3G\n- **PWA Score:** Lighthouse 90+\n- **Installation Rate:** 70%+ PWA installs\n- **Offline Reliability:** 99%+ sync success\n\n### **🔧 TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE:**\n- **Responsive Detection:** Mobile routes for < 768px\n- **Offline Storage:** IndexedDB with user isolation\n- **Background Sync:** Queue-based with retry logic\n- **Push Notifications:** Web Push API integration\n- **PWA Features:** Installable with shortcuts\n\n### **👥 USER EXPERIENCES:**\n\n#### **Captain Workflow:**\n1. Dashboard → Team overview, quick actions\n2. Team → Manage roster, add/verify players\n3. Live → View matches, tournament bracket\n4. Media → Venue photos/videos\n5. Chat → Communicate with venue participants\n\n#### **Player Workflow:**\n1. Dashboard → Team status, upcoming matches\n2. Team → View teammates, upload documents\n3. Live → Follow tournament progress\n4. Media → Browse venue content\n5. Chat → Connect with other teams\n\n### **🚀 IMPLEMENTATION READINESS:**\n- **Builds on existing offline architecture** we just completed\n- **Extends volunteer IndexedDB patterns** for mobile data\n- **Leverages current authentication system** with role detection\n- **Integrates with existing notification schema**\n- **Uses established sync patterns** for mobile optimization\n\n**This is a comprehensive, production-ready mobile implementation plan that transforms the tournament experience for captains and players with offline-first PWA capabilities! Ready to start Phase 1? 🎯**"
